        <mxCell id="alignment_note" value="&lt;b&gt;H-06 validation order (server side):&lt;/b&gt; (1) all listed prerequisites must be satisfied by at least one PASSED student completion record in any semester; (2) exclude full sections where enrolled_count reaches capacity; (3) check meeting-time conflicts. Explain unmet prerequisites and full sections. All catalogue, completion and capacity values are simulated; no official registration or seat is checked." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F8FB;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
